Error [E0204]: `node.direct` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> projected_write_window_overlap.jet:11:31
    |
 11 |     merge(&node.direct, &node.direct)
    |                               ^^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through the write-access marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass the write-access marker `&` (`&node.direct`) only once, or copy first with `~node.direct`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
